  "buildup": {
    "comment": "Cascade build-up (#191). pitch.maxSteps: the pitch stops rising after this many cascade steps. glow: strength of the lit dominoes' glow, from litMin (first lit) to litMax (all lit). strip: height of the strip at the top of the board mat kept free for the counter and callouts (the tree is laid out below it); counter.at and callouts.at are where in the mat's width they are centred, so each screen's own mat sets where they go. They stay put on screen whatever the camera does. callouts.list: the running damage that fires each word, once each, at most max per cascade (the highest newly crossed fires; lower ones are used up with it). camera: boards with more than minNodes dominoes ease out (to zoomOut, or what fits the board mat, never below minZoom) and push in on a new biggest cap of at least push.minCap (push.reducedZoom with reduced flashing; no push with screen shake off); the camera never cuts off health, block or the intent card (keep: sizes of the boxes it protects and of an open end). Callouts: holdFraction of ms they stay, then fade; fadeInMs, popMs, startScale, popScale shape the burst. Times are ms at 1x.",
